 "text": "Real Property Search Options | Ellis County, KS - Official Website\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nGovernment\nAbout Us\nServices\nI Want To...\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments\nAppraiser\nReal Property Search Options\nReal Property Search Options\nEllis County Real Property Search Options\nEllis County Real Property Portal\nPublic Access to the Real Property Portal features searches shown below. Select the down arrow of a search type and enter search criteria. Also available are links to property taxes and GIS maps.\nEllis County ORKA\nORKA is a partnership between the Kansas Department of Revenue- Property Valuation Division, the Kansas Data Access and Support Center (DASC), and Kansas counties.\nSearch options include Address, Name, County ID #s and Section-Township-Range. The Layers option allows users to turn on and off map layers, including aerial photography dating back to 2014.\nAppeals\nAppraisal\nComparable Sales Report\nForms\nLinks\nReal Property Search Options\nStatutes\nTax Information\nNotifications\nAgendas & Minutes\nReport a Concern\nCounty Maps\nReal Property Search Options\nTax Search\nCareers\nEllis County, KS\nAdministrative Center\n718 Main Street\nHays, KS 67601\nPhone: 785-628-9410\nQuick Links\nCommunity Resources\nEmployee Access\nAgenda & Minutes\nCareers\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nHome\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLet us serve you.\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose